<title>JAPAN: Kokuyo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kokuyo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		145.73		vs	  137.43</p>
<p> Operating	    7.99		vs	    5.08</p>
<p> Current		8.13		vs	    5.28</p>
<p> Net		    5.10		vs	    3.53</p>
<p> EPS		   39.02 yen	  vs	   26.99 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    131 million	  vs	 131 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.50 yen	  vs	    7.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kokuyo Co Ltd is a leading manufacturer of paper stationery.</p>
